460
00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:27.640
It was land owned by the famous singing cowboy movie star Gene Autry.

461
00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:34.100
Gene Autry also owned the California Angels baseball team and the Los Angeles news station

462
00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:38.980
KTLA Channel 5, which was the first TV station on the West CoaSt.

