00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:46.460
Randy also shared that the Walt Disney Company purchased the property in 1959 and established

464
00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:50.340
a movie location on a still-working horse and cattle ranch.

465
00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:51.420
